WEBVTT

1
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:50.500
In the first verse of Chapter 17,

2
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.500
Arjun had asked –

3
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.291
what is the state

4
00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:56.333
of those who act with faith

5
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.500
even while remaining outside

6
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.125
the boundaries of scripture?

7
00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:03.166
In this second verse, Lord Krishna

8
00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:06.208
begins to answer this question.

9
00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:08.083
He explains that faith

10
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:09.916
is not the same in all.

11
00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:11.416
Every person's faith

12
00:01:11.416 --> 00:01:13.916
depends on their nature.

13
00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:17.333
And this nature is not formed by chance.

14
00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:20.416
It takes shape under the influence of the three

15
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:21.833
long-standing gunas – sattva, rajas,

16
00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:24.791
and tamas.

17
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:27.125
As a person's faith is,

18
00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:29.833
so too is their worship.

19
00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:33.500
That is, whichever guna is dominant

20
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.125
in someone's consciousness,
their method of worship

21
00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:38.666
and practice becomes a reflection
of that very guna.

22
00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:45.291
Lord Krishna says –

23
00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:48.125
within every being there is faith,

24
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:51.083
but it is not the same in all.

25
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:53.416
It is of three kinds –

26
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:57.041
sattvic, rajasic, and tamasic.

27
00:01:57.041 --> 00:02:00.083
This faith is not formed by chance.

28
00:02:00.083 --> 00:02:03.166
It arises from our nature.

29
00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:07.083
And this nature is not formed on its own, rather

30
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:09.333
it takes shape from the impressions

31
00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:12.833
of many lifetimes, our choices, and our habits.

32
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:13.833
This is why the Gita

33
00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.750
calls it svabhavaja shraddha.

34
00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:18.125
That is, faith

35
00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:20.666
is born from within us,

36
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:23.875
it is not always a conscious choice.

37
00:02:23.875 --> 00:02:26.875
Many people believe that faith

38
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:29.250
is always pure and the same.

39
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.916
But Lord Krishna says –

40
00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:33.041
faith too is coloured,

41
00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:35.750
bound by the influence of the gunas.

42
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.125
Just as our taste in food,

43
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:39.666
or our early experience

44
00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:42.750
of music, is formed through continuous practice,

45
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.125
in the same way our faith too

46
00:02:45.125 --> 00:02:49.416
develops from past impressions and habits.

47
00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:52.833
This is why people raised in different

48
00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:55.041
impressions hold different beliefs,

49
00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:58.708
and changing them is not easy.

50
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:01.750
But this is not a permanent bondage.

51
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.625
Although our present faith and belief

52
00:03:04.625 --> 00:03:06.041
has taken shape

53
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:08.541
from our past experiences,

54
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:12.083
still their level can be raised –

55
00:03:12.083 --> 00:03:17.041
from fear toward love, from
confusion toward clarity, 

56
00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:20.208
and from guilt toward grace.

57
00:03:20.208 --> 00:03:23.291
Through scripture, reflection, and the company

58
00:03:23.291 --> 00:03:26.291
of saints, faith gradually rises –

59
00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:30.083
from tamas to rajas, from rajas to
sattva, and ultimately,

60
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:34.416
going beyond sattva, it connects
with the Supreme.

61
00:03:34.416 --> 00:03:35.958
Whatever the starting point

62
00:03:35.958 --> 00:03:39.708
you may have received from
tradition and heritage,

63
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:44.500
the destination will be the one you
choose for yourself.

64
00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.375
And the goal is just this – to purify the heart

65
00:03:48.375 --> 00:03:52.250
and connect faith with the eternal truth.

66
00:03:57.208 --> 00:03:59.708
Listen – even though you

67
00:03:59.708 --> 00:04:04.875
may not be aware of it, the beliefs you
hold about your life,

68
00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:08.875
your devotion, and your own self,

69
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:12.083
have arisen not from some carefully

70
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:16.791
made decision, but from your nature
and surroundings.

71
00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:21.250
This nature has come from your upbringing, the

72
00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.875
influence of your early environment,

73
00:04:22.875 --> 00:04:26.791
and your repeated habits.

74
00:04:26.791 --> 00:04:29.666
This nature is a disposition

75
00:04:29.666 --> 00:04:32.958
shaped by the influence

76
00:04:32.958 --> 00:04:37.000
of a lifetime of experiences.

77
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.458
And it is from this that your faith has emerged.

78
00:04:40.458 --> 00:04:43.375
But I want to tell you – just because

79
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:46.375
circumstances have formed your nature,

80
00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:51.166
it does not mean that you have
to stay stuck there.

81
00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:54.916
Faith can develop again.

82
00:04:54.916 --> 00:04:57.250
You can grow –

83
00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.666
from fear-based belief, toward a loving

84
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:04.750
connection, from confusion toward clarity,

85
00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:08.791
from guilt toward dignified compassion.

86
00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:13.041
But that change will not happen automatically.

87
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:16.791
It requires awareness.

88
00:05:16.791 --> 00:05:18.666
It begins

89
00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:22.833
when you pause and ask –

90
00:05:22.833 --> 00:05:26.375
why do I believe what I believe?

91
00:05:26.375 --> 00:05:30.291
Is it helping me to grow?

92
00:05:30.291 --> 00:05:35.500
Through scripture, reflection,
and spiritual company,

93
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.333
you can grow.

94
00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:39.333
Step by step.

95
00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:43.333
From tamas to rajas, from rajas to sattva,

96
00:05:43.333 --> 00:05:48.083
and ultimately go even beyond that.

97
00:05:48.083 --> 00:05:49.416
Your starting

98
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:52.166
point may be inherited,

99
00:05:52.166 --> 00:05:56.750
but your destination depends
on your own choice.

100
00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:03.125
From childhood

101
00:06:03.125 --> 00:06:06.416
you must have seen many
practices in your home –

102
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:12.291
fasts, worship, chanting of mantras,
or daily rituals.

103
00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:13.208
And perhaps

104
00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:17.250
unknowingly, you accepted them
as sacred truth.

105
00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.666
But pause and think –

106
00:06:20.666 --> 00:06:24.083
are these traditions taking you
toward compassion,

107
00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:27.833
clarity, and peace?

108
00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:31.000
The purpose of tradition is to show the path,

109
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:32.500
not to bind.

110
00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:33.791
It is only a map

111
00:06:33.791 --> 00:06:35.791
received from the past to give

112
00:06:35.791 --> 00:06:38.041
direction to life –

113
00:06:38.041 --> 00:06:39.875
not some wall

114
00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:43.166
that limits the possibilities of the future.

115
00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:46.000
Your nature, over time, may become

116
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.000
attached to certain customs.

117
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:52.166
But if they have become mere habit,

118
00:06:52.166 --> 00:06:56.166
or have turned into blind following,

119
00:06:56.166 --> 00:07:00.916
then the time has come to look at
them with a new perspective.

120
00:07:00.916 --> 00:07:06.208
I do not ask you to abandon your roots,

121
00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:12.666
but rather to water them with
the water of new understanding.

122
00:07:12.666 --> 00:07:17.291
Do not only tell your children ‘what to do’,

123
00:07:17.291 --> 00:07:19.750
also explain to them –

124
00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.125
‘why to do it.’

125
00:07:21.125 --> 00:07:25.208
Let your home become a place

126
00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.750
where devotion is done with meaning

127
00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:31.416
and awareness, and not

128
00:07:31.416 --> 00:07:35.333
merely repeated in a rote manner.

129
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:38.916
When tradition receives the
company of thought,

130
00:07:38.916 --> 00:07:41.833
only then does it become eternal.

131
00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:44.458
Begin from where

132
00:07:44.458 --> 00:07:47.958
you received your inheritance, but

133
00:07:47.958 --> 00:07:50.500
carry it forward

134
00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.000
from the place where it had stopped.

135
00:07:58.833 --> 00:07:59.916
At the workplace

136
00:07:59.916 --> 00:08:03.875
you do not light a lamp, you do
not chant mantras –

137
00:08:03.875 --> 00:08:05.666
but this does not mean

138
00:08:05.666 --> 00:08:08.083
that faith is absent there.

139
00:08:08.083 --> 00:08:10.000
Every workplace has

140
00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:13.125
its own kind of ‘worship.’

141
00:08:13.125 --> 00:08:15.583
Some people chase success

142
00:08:15.583 --> 00:08:18.625
as if it were a deity,

143
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:20.583
some take busyness, position,

144
00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:24.125
or control to be the highest thing.

145
00:08:24.125 --> 00:08:27.875
These values do not come by chance –

146
00:08:27.875 --> 00:08:32.750
they arise from those subtle
habits and mindsets

147
00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.625
that you perhaps adopt

148
00:08:35.625 --> 00:08:38.875
without even being aware of it.

149
00:08:38.875 --> 00:08:43.166
Over time, these very repeated practices

150
00:08:43.166 --> 00:08:46.833
shape your professional nature.

151
00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:49.500
You begin to believe

152
00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.291
that being constantly available is dedication,

153
00:08:53.291 --> 00:08:57.500
or that your own importance

154
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.291
depends on the recognition of others.

155
00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:03.250
Slowly this belief

156
00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:07.583
begins to define your way of working –

157
00:09:07.583 --> 00:09:13.083
in stress, restlessness, and constant

158
00:09:13.083 --> 00:09:16.500
running about. I want you to see –

159
00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:21.375
at the workplace too, your faith matters.

160
00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:23.750
It shapes your priorities,

161
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.208
your decisions,

162
00:09:25.208 --> 00:09:29.291
and your identity.

163
00:09:29.291 --> 00:09:32.958
Do not simply adopt whatever everyone
else is doing.

164
00:09:32.958 --> 00:09:34.708
Pause and think.

165
00:09:34.708 --> 00:09:37.375
Ask yourself –

166
00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:40.916
is my work culture based on clarity,

167
00:09:40.916 --> 00:09:42.541
or on confusion?

168
00:09:42.541 --> 00:09:45.041
On compassion, or on comparison?

169
00:09:45.041 --> 00:09:47.750
What you adopt again and again

170
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:51.666
becomes your deep faith.

171
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:56.666
And what you believe, that is ultimately

172
00:09:56.666 --> 00:09:59.041
what you become.

173
00:09:59.041 --> 00:10:03.458
When the thinking changes,
the personality changes!

174
00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:04.375
Reflect on this.
